{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13218210","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13218210","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1321821001:1":{"text":"올가, 다녀왔습니다... 별 일 없었나요?","source_cn":"奥尔嘉，我们回来了……你还好吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCDB2AA658717CCBD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1321821002:1":{"text":"아빠랑 엄마가... 보고싶어요. 흑흑흑...","source_cn":"我……我想爸爸妈妈……呜呜……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x73CC55AE8D5B422E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1321821003:1":{"text":"올가, 잘 들으세요. 아버지를 해친 범인을 찾아서 복수를 하고 오는 길입니다. 무슨 말인지 알아 들었지요?","source_cn":"奥尔嘉，听着，我们找到了杀死你爸爸的凶手，也给你的爸爸...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x17D30A58F23E7A80","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1321821004:1":{"text":"네... 이해했어요... 고마워요. 하지만... 아빠도 없고, 이제는 저 혼자 남았는데, 흑흑...","source_cn":"嗯……我明白……谢谢你们。可是……爸爸走了，以后就没人...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x55858520B4F70845","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1321821005:1":{"text":"시더 마을에서 가져온 음식입니다. 어서 먹어보세요. 맛있다면 앞으로 계속 사다 줄게요.","source_cn":"这是我从雪松镇买来的食物，拿着，尝尝看……如果你喜欢吃...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3CB8E59868B5A870","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1321821006:1":{"text":"앞으로... 계속요?","source_cn":"以后……还会……？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC95EBB44EBC19936","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1321821007:1":{"text":"올가, 당신은 혼자가 아니에요.","source_cn":"奥尔嘉，不会没人管你的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2FA87BE9962F1AEF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1321821008:1":{"text":"팔라모르... 으아앙...","source_cn":"法拉莫尔大叔，呜呜……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB941BAA09362D74E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1321821009:3":{"text":"착한 아이네요. 하지만 너무 꼭 끌어안지는 마세요. 방금 전까지 위험한 곳에 있어서, 나쁜 마법이 제 몸에 남아 있을지도 모르니까요.","source_cn":"好孩子，别抱太紧，我们刚从危险的地方回来，可能身上还残...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC1A523EC4058DE68","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1321821010:1":{"text":"상관 없어요. 흑흑흑...","source_cn":"我不管，呜呜……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1B1FCC6E3762D420","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:12:1321821010":{"tex